{
  "name": "韩漫站（竖排长图 + 全站懒加载）",
  "type": "korean",
  "baseUrl": "https://hanman-b.example",
  "input": "https://hanman-b.example/",
  "routes": [
    { "match": "exact:/", "page": "home.html" },
    { "match": "prefix:/manga/2001", "page": "detail_001.html" },
    { "match": "prefix:/manga/2002", "page": "detail_002.html" },
    { "match": "prefix:/read/2001", "page": "reader.html" }
  ],
  "home": {
    "selector": "div.book-grid > div.book-card",
    "expectedCount": 16,
    "titleFrom": "text",
    "coverAttr": "data-original"
  },
  "detail": {
    "titleSelector": "h1.detail-title",
    "chapterSelector": "ul.episode-list a",
    "pages": [
      { "page": "detail_001.html", "expectedChapterCount": 60 },
      { "page": "detail_002.html", "expectedChapterCount": 24 }
    ]
  },
  "reader": {
    "page": "reader.html",
    "imageSelector": "div.viewer > img",
    "imageAttr": "data-original",
    "expectedImageCount": 28
  },
  "notes": "韩漫的两个特征都在这：封面/正文图全是 blank.gif 占位 + data-original 真地址（拿到占位图就等于整页空白），正文是 28 张 800x2400 的竖条长图。目录页顶部还有一条「最新话」快捷入口，和完整目录指向同一批地址，用来验证去重。"
}
